  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: " GAME STORY\n\n Artificial intelligence has gone out of control. They've
    \n\ntaken over defense, security, and production systems. \n\nHumanity has been
    excluded by the systems it created. \n\nThese artificial intelligences are constantly
    updating \n\nthemselves, correcting their mistakes, and becoming more  powerful.
    \n\nAll these updates are managed from a single point.\n\n Outside the city,
    there's an industrial facility that looks abandoned. \nBut this facility is actually
    the central software server for the artificial intelligences and the distribution
    point for updates and control algorithms\n\n As long as the facility is running,
    the artificial intelligences will continue to learn. \n\nHumanity will not be
    able to return. \n\nYou are a former facility security operator. You know this
    area. \n\nYou know how the systems work, and you know this: There is only one
    manual shutdown button in this facility. \n\nThe artificial intelligences cannot
    touch this button because it is a forbidden access in their software. \n\n PURPOSE\n\nThe
    artificial intelligences are attacking you. To them, you are an unidentified
    threat. \n\nYou have access to the shutdown button. They have to stop this. \n\nEnter
    the facility, bypass the AI \u200B\u200Bprotections, reach the Energy Central
    Control Room, and shut down the Central Software Update System with a single
    button. \n\nWhen this button is pressed, the AIs will not receive updates. The
    systems stop. The facility goes silent. The AI \u200B\u200Bnetwork collapses."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
